From: Remote Project <bots@joleeconsultants.com>
Subject: Accept post-restore mic/webcam false immediately

After restore posts pipelineControl enable, the next false status is
definitive (permission deny / getUserMedia fail) — clear the guard and
dim UI without waiting ~8s. Premature false before enable posts is still
ignored. Optional viewer error names (NotAllowedError/NotFoundError/
SecurityError) also accept false while the guard is active. Shorten
reality fallbacks to ~2s/~4s. Keep localStorage wanted=true.

